1
00:00:00,768 --> 00:00:02,168
Previously on
The Big Bang Theory...

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:04,080
(Susan:)Dad,
this is Sheldon's mother, Mary.

3
00:00:04,268 --> 00:00:04,968
How do you do?

4
00:00:04,965 --> 00:00:06,185
Nice to meet you.

5
00:00:06,183 --> 00:00:07,213
And, of course, Mom.

6
00:00:07,217 --> 00:00:09,387
Hello, my hateful shrew.

7
00:00:09,386 --> 00:00:12,976
Hello to you,
you wrinkled old bastard.

8
00:00:15,142 --> 00:00:16,312
(Sheldon:)Hey.

9
00:00:16,309 --> 00:00:19,109
Just got an e-mail
from the U.S. Air Force.

10
00:00:19,112 --> 00:00:23,202
I'm just afraid if I respond,
then they'll know I got it.

11
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:25,700
Dude, the minute you opened that
e-mail, they knew you got it.

12
00:00:25,702 --> 00:00:26,622
I mean, they're probably
looking at you

13
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:29,570
through the camera
right now.

14
00:00:29,573 --> 00:00:31,323
Oh, God.

15
00:00:31,324 --> 00:00:33,544
I think someone's
following us.

16
00:00:34,911 --> 00:00:37,211
Uh, turn left here
and see if he turns with us.

17
00:00:37,214 --> 00:00:39,244
Why is he turning here?
The restaurant's the other way.

18
00:00:39,249 --> 00:00:41,419
(Howard:)I don't know.
He uses that traffic app.

19
00:00:41,418 --> 00:00:42,748
Maybe there's an accident.

20
00:00:42,752 --> 00:00:44,332
Oh, so follow him.

21
00:00:44,337 --> 00:00:47,227
Oh, no!

22
00:00:48,058 --> 00:00:49,138
Leonard, if you don't mind,

23
00:00:49,142 --> 00:00:50,392
I think I'm a little tired.

24
00:00:50,393 --> 00:00:51,473
I'm gonna call it a night.

25
00:00:51,478 --> 00:00:52,678
Sure, Dad.

26
00:00:52,679 --> 00:00:54,429
I'm a little
tuckered out myself.

27
00:00:54,431 --> 00:00:57,651
Well, I will see you
all in the morning.

28
00:00:57,651 --> 00:00:59,101
Would you like to share a cab?

29
00:00:59,102 --> 00:01:00,182
That would be fine.

30
00:01:00,187 --> 00:01:01,937
Where are you staying?
I'm at the Westin.

